{"id":"137fba496ea55bfa","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-il-ilm-calculi.md","title":"IL与ILM的完整公理闭包","display":"df-il-ilm-calculi — IL与ILM的完整公理闭包","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-il-ilm-calculi","aliases":["72-df-il-ilm-calculi"],"display":"df-il-ilm-calculi — IL与ILM的完整公理闭包","depends_on":["[[72-df-interpretability-modal-language]]"],"chapter":"VII","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VII §13, print514/PDF526; precise local finite-stage presentation","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-il-ilm-calculi"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-il-ilm-calculi</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-il-ilm-calculi — IL与ILM的完整公理闭包"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c0c97c65cc2f7158\" href=\"?note=c0c97c65cc2f7158\" title=\"72-df-interpretability-modal-language\">72-df-interpretability-modal-language</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VII"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VII §13, print514/PDF526; precise local finite-stage presentation"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\\in\\mathcal F_{\\triangleright}\">\\(A,B,C\\in\\mathcal F_{\\triangleright}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b:\\mathcal U_I\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(b:\\mathcal U_I\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\epsilon\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。布尔宏、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Diamond_m\">\\(\\Diamond_m\\)</span> 使用本语言的同一构造式。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U_I,\\tau_b,\\mathsf{IL}_\\epsilon\">\\(\\mathcal U_I,\\tau_b,\\mathsf{IL}_\\epsilon\\)</span> 在下式引入。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal U_I&amp;:=\\{p_i:i\\in\\omega\\}\\cup\\{\\Box_m A:A\\in\\mathcal F_{\\triangleright}\\}\\cup\\{A\\triangleright B:A,B\\in\\mathcal F_{\\triangleright}\\},\\\\\n\\tau_b(p_i)&amp;:=b(p_i),\\quad\\tau_b(\\bot_m):=0,\\quad\n\\tau_b(A\\to_m B):=\\max(1-\\tau_b(A),\\tau_b(B)),\\\\\n\\tau_b(\\Box_m A)&amp;:=b(\\Box_m A),\\quad\\tau_b(A\\triangleright B):=b(A\\triangleright B),\\\\\n\\mathsf{PT}_I&amp;:=\\{A\\in\\mathcal F_{\\triangleright}:\\forall b\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathcal U_I}\\ \\tau_b(A)=1\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf K_I&amp;:=\\{\\Box_m(A\\to_m B)\\to_m(\\Box_m A\\to_m\\Box_m B):A,B\\in\\mathcal F_{\\triangleright}\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf L_I&amp;:=\\{\\Box_m(\\Box_m A\\to_m A)\\to_m\\Box_m A:A\\in\\mathcal F_{\\triangleright}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal U_I&amp;:=\\{p_i:i\\in\\omega\\}\\cup\\{\\Box_m A:A\\in\\mathcal F_{\\triangleright}\\}\\cup\\{A\\triangleright B:A,B\\in\\mathcal F_{\\triangleright}\\},\\\\\n\\tau_b(p_i)&amp;:=b(p_i),\\quad\\tau_b(\\bot_m):=0,\\quad\n\\tau_b(A\\to_m B):=\\max(1-\\tau_b(A),\\tau_b(B)),\\\\\n\\tau_b(\\Box_m A)&amp;:=b(\\Box_m A),\\quad\\tau_b(A\\triangleright B):=b(A\\triangleright B),\\\\\n\\mathsf{PT}_I&amp;:=\\{A\\in\\mathcal F_{\\triangleright}:\\forall b\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathcal U_I}\\ \\tau_b(A)=1\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf K_I&amp;:=\\{\\Box_m(A\\to_m B)\\to_m(\\Box_m A\\to_m\\Box_m B):A,B\\in\\mathcal F_{\\triangleright}\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf L_I&amp;:=\\{\\Box_m(\\Box_m A\\to_m A)\\to_m\\Box_m A:A\\in\\mathcal F_{\\triangleright}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf J_1&amp;:=\\{\\Box_m(A\\to_m B)\\to_m(A\\triangleright B):A,B\\in\\mathcal F_{\\triangleright}\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf J_2&amp;:=\\{((A\\triangleright B)\\land_m(B\\triangleright C))\\to_m(A\\triangleright C):A,B,C\\in\\mathcal F_{\\triangleright}\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf J_3&amp;:=\\{((A\\triangleright C)\\land_m(B\\triangleright C))\\to_m((A\\lor_m B)\\triangleright C):A,B,C\\in\\mathcal F_{\\triangleright}\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf J_4&amp;:=\\{(A\\triangleright B)\\to_m(\\Diamond_m A\\to_m\\Diamond_m B):A,B\\in\\mathcal F_{\\triangleright}\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf J_5&amp;:=\\{\\Diamond_m A\\triangleright A:A\\in\\mathcal F_{\\triangleright}\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf M_0&amp;:=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\mathsf M_1&amp;:=\\{(A\\triangleright B)\\to_m((A\\land_m\\Box_m C)\\triangleright(B\\land_m\\Box_m C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathcal F_{\\triangleright}\\},\\\\\nH^\\epsilon_0&amp;:=\\mathsf{PT}_I\\cup\\mathsf K_I\\cup\\mathsf L_I\\cup\\bigcup_{1\\le j\\le5}\\mathsf J_j\\cup\\mathsf M_\\epsilon,\\\\\nH^\\epsilon_{n+1}&amp;:=H^\\epsilon_n\\cup\\{B\\in\\mathcal F_{\\triangleright}:\\exists A\\in H^\\epsilon_n\\ ((A\\to_m B)\\in H^\\epsilon_n)\\}\\cup\\{\\Box_m A:A\\in H^\\epsilon_n\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{IL}_\\epsilon&amp;:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}H^\\epsilon_n,\\qquad\n\\mathsf{IL}:=\\mathsf{IL}_0,\\quad\\mathsf{ILM}:=\\mathsf{IL}_1,\\\\\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{IL}_\\epsilon} A&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow A\\in\\mathsf{IL}_\\epsilon.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf J_1&amp;:=\\{\\Box_m(A\\to_m B)\\to_m(A\\triangleright B):A,B\\in\\mathcal F_{\\triangleright}\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf J_2&amp;:=\\{((A\\triangleright B)\\land_m(B\\triangleright C))\\to_m(A\\triangleright C):A,B,C\\in\\mathcal F_{\\triangleright}\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf J_3&amp;:=\\{((A\\triangleright C)\\land_m(B\\triangleright C))\\to_m((A\\lor_m B)\\triangleright C):A,B,C\\in\\mathcal F_{\\triangleright}\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf J_4&amp;:=\\{(A\\triangleright B)\\to_m(\\Diamond_m A\\to_m\\Diamond_m B):A,B\\in\\mathcal F_{\\triangleright}\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf J_5&amp;:=\\{\\Diamond_m A\\triangleright A:A\\in\\mathcal F_{\\triangleright}\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf M_0&amp;:=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\mathsf M_1&amp;:=\\{(A\\triangleright B)\\to_m((A\\land_m\\Box_m C)\\triangleright(B\\land_m\\Box_m C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathcal F_{\\triangleright}\\},\\\\\nH^\\epsilon_0&amp;:=\\mathsf{PT}_I\\cup\\mathsf K_I\\cup\\mathsf L_I\\cup\\bigcup_{1\\le j\\le5}\\mathsf J_j\\cup\\mathsf M_\\epsilon,\\\\\nH^\\epsilon_{n+1}&amp;:=H^\\epsilon_n\\cup\\{B\\in\\mathcal F_{\\triangleright}:\\exists A\\in H^\\epsilon_n\\ ((A\\to_m B)\\in H^\\epsilon_n)\\}\\cup\\{\\Box_m A:A\\in H^\\epsilon_n\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{IL}_\\epsilon&amp;:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}H^\\epsilon_n,\\qquad\n\\mathsf{IL}:=\\mathsf{IL}_0,\\quad\\mathsf{ILM}:=\\mathsf{IL}_1,\\\\\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{IL}_\\epsilon} A&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow A\\in\\mathsf{IL}_\\epsilon.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>显式包含正常模态 K、Löb、公理 J1–J5，以及 MP、仅对定理的必然化。ε=1 再加入 Montagna 模式。命题重言式把整个方框式和解释性式视为独立布尔原子；未把模态语义有效性直接作为公理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-interpretability-modal-language","status":"resolved","id"